      "created_at": "2012-08-24T23:24:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know I'm 'new' techically but I have played this game. having a challenge is one of the major things in any game and I like to muse about which heroes would/could have a better time against certain villains and vice versa. I was on Spiff's website when I saw the randomizer button and on a whim clicked it to see just what 5 (random heroes I'd get) along with villain and environment. I got Unity, Fixer, Pat, Vis and Tempest against Chairman in Rook City. Something just spells ow in that sentence but I don't know what.</p><p>So, my musings have turned to this topic title and (hopeful) discussion. If it's been made, you can merge it but having a nice compiled list wouldn't hurt either.</p>",
