      "id": 36683,
      "name": "EvanDan55",
      "username": "EvanDan55",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-25T03:24:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, what AWP about Tachyon was my thoughts. Preventing Matriarch's \"revenge\" damage is vital. I also find the strategy that is key to winning against her is having one or two heroes that can charge up their attacks and devistate her in one hit, since she has high healing benefits. The three that come to mind are obviously Tacky's \"Lightspeed Barrage\", Haka's \"Savage Mana\" (which, in the new printing, even gives the suggestion to use it against Matriarch since you can clearly see him ready to tear birds out of the sky), and Bunker's \"Omnicannon\". You can't really chip away at Matriarch, or she'll heal.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:10:33.611Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
