      "created_at": "2012-08-25T05:48:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I NEVER use Tachyon against the Matriarch. My A team for her is Visionary, Wraith, Absolute Zero, and Bunker. Smoke Bombs works wonders against her. Also, turning the revenge damage to fire and using coolant blast will annihilate her.</p>",
